00:08:27.510 --> 00:08:29.100
even legacy media outlets

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:32.100
have started relying more
on heavily charged emotions

00:08:32.100 --> 00:08:33.360
and extreme opinions.

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:35.940
This is exemplified by
someone like Tucker Carlson,

00:08:35.940 --> 00:08:38.100
who fended off a slander lawsuit in 2020

