It's the military in space.

00:09:40.380 --> 00:09:42.900
- It's worth noting that
news hasn't always been

00:09:42.900 --> 00:09:44.220
about the hustle to make money.

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:47.377
Mark Gunther notes that as
recently as the late 1970s

00:09:47.377 --> 00:09:49.890
"There was no network news business.

00:09:49.890 --> 00:09:52.350
The Big Three broadcast
television networks

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:53.430
all covered news,

00:09:53.430 --> 00:09:55.890
but none generally made money doing so.

00:09:55.890 --> 00:09:58.680
Nor did they expect to turn
a profit from news program."

00:09:58.680 --> 00:10:01.350
In contrast, as scholar,
Jayson Harsin, notes,

00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:04.320
internet news rapidly became
a money-making venture,

00:10:04.320 --> 00:10:07.200
