00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:10.230
is not designed to suit
democratic political communication

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:11.640
or trust-worthy information,

00:10:11.640 --> 00:10:15.540
but rather to suit recent
forms of consumer capitalism,

00:10:15.540 --> 00:10:17.580
the attention economy."

00:10:17.580 --> 00:10:18.720
As we've become habituated

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:21.120
to perpetually shocking headlines,

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:22.830
disinformation has flourished.

