00:13:15.330 --> 00:13:18.870
how can we recognize or
construct legitimate authority?

00:13:18.870 --> 00:13:21.300
The link between the
language used in advertising

00:13:21.300 --> 00:13:23.520
and the language used
to spread disinformation

00:13:23.520 --> 00:13:24.690
becomes all the more apparent

00:13:24.690 --> 00:13:26.640
when we look at the way Alex Jones

00:13:26.640 --> 00:13:29.970
uses the same platforms to
propagate political rumors

00:13:29.970 --> 00:13:31.950
and to sell dubious products,

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:34.200
like super male vitality supplements,

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:35.730
which I definitely didn't take

00:13:35.730 --> 00:13:37.830
and which definitely didn't
give me a second penis

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:40.710
that knew all the words
to every kid rock song.

00:13:40.710 --> 00:13:42.960
- That's how we fund this revolution

00:13:42.960 --> 00:13:44.190
against the New World Order.

00:13:44.190 --> 00:13:47.760
- In short, our culture
is saturated in (bleep)

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:49.350
and we're used to being lied to

00:13:49.350 --> 00:13:52.050
by basically everyone at all times.

00:13:52.050 --> 00:13:53.220
It's a fun way to live, right?

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:54.630
Feeling like we can't trust anything,

00:13:54.630 --> 00:13:56.610
