00:13:56.610 --> 00:13:58.380
You can trust me though, maybe.

00:13:58.380 --> 00:13:59.527
As Harsin argues,

00:13:59.527 --> 00:14:02.250
"American democracy has
been, among other things,

00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:04.590
an evolving competition of fakery.

00:14:04.590 --> 00:14:06.930
It could be said that
people would be irrational

00:14:06.930 --> 00:14:09.960
not to be highly skeptical
