00:14:17.730 --> 00:14:20.970
to portray the news fully,
accurately, and fairly.

00:14:20.970 --> 00:14:24.360
By 2021, just 29% of Americans

00:14:24.360 --> 00:14:27.120
said they have a fair amount
of trust for the news.

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:28.957
And as journalists Tom Dow writes,

00:14:28.957 --> 00:14:31.320
"When people cease to
trust the authorities,

00:14:31.320 --> 00:14:33.240
they, some of them anyway,

00:14:33.240 --> 00:14:36.000
