and more credulous."

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:38.280
And fake news is all too ready

00:14:38.280 --> 00:14:41.040
to slide into the credulous folks' DMs.

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:43.410
Thus, it's never been
easier to fall for something

00:14:43.410 --> 00:14:44.697
